>> >> includes
>> >> spebu'a. i la stiv. me'ispe mi .ije mi spebu'a la stiv. i mi me'ispe
>> >> noda
>> >> .ini'ibo mi na speni
>> >
>> >
>> > me'ispe: s1 is a brother-in-law (sister's spouse) of m2 under
